S","Windows XP/Vista/7"],["Processor","Core 2 Duo 2.33GHz (Athlon X2 5000+)"],["Memory","2 GB RAM"],["Graphics","GeForce FX 8800 (Radeon HD3850) 256Mb"],["DirectX\u00ae","9.0c"],["Hard Drive","3 GB HD space"],["Other Requirements","Broadband Internet connection"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"Men of War: Condemned Heroes is a standalone entry in the series, a real-time tactics game set on the Eastern Front in World War II. You lead a Soviet penal battalion, made up of punished soldiers sent on dangerous missions. The campaign draws on real events, and you command small groups of infantry, use cover, capture vehicles and take direct control of units when precision matters.\n\nIt is a demanding tactics game, where losing a few soldiers can change how a mission plays out. Besides the single-player campaign, it supports co-op, LAN and competitive multiplayer. Condemned Heroes suits fans of earlier Men of War games who want a harder, story-focused campaign with a darker side of the war."}}